  Connection health · work
  Company SSO. No conversation or tool is replayed.

› 1. Refresh diagnostics      Read configuration and health; no inference request.
  2. Verify gateway access    Confirm a minimal inference request; no conversation, files or tools.
  3. Restore company sign-in  Sign in as the same person; preserve this conversation and draft.
  4. gateway access · OK      Gateway access verified. Client correlation ID: fixture
  5. MCP · service-now        Not verified · select to reconnect
  6. Diagnostic report        Preview, copy or save a report with private identifiers omitted.
  7. Manage MCP connections   Add a gateway server, sign in, reconnect or check discovered tools.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
